Here is a complete, professional HTML portfolio template with a clean light/bright theme. It features a white background, navy/dark text, soft teal accent colors, responsive layout with CSS Grid and Flexbox, and all standard portfolio sections: navigation, hero, portfolio grid, contact, and footer. Replace `__TOPIC__` with your specific topic.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Portfolio — __TOPIC__</title>
  <style>
    /* === RESET & BASE === */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;
      background-color: #fafafa;
      color: #1e293b;
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a {
      color: #0d9488;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    a:hover {
      color: #0f766e;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    /* === UTILITY === */
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #64748b;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn--primary {
      background-color: #0d9488;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn--primary:hover {
      background-color: #0f766e;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.25);
    }

    .btn--outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #0d9488;
      border: 2px solid #0d9488;
    }

    .btn--outline:hover {
      background-color: #0d9488;
      color: #fff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* === NAVIGATION === */
    .navbar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .navbar .container {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 68px;
    }

    .navbar__logo {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .navbar__logo span {
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    .navbar__links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .navbar__links a {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #475569;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .navbar__links a:hover {
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    /* === HERO === */
    .hero {
      padding: 140px 0 80px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero__badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ccfbf1;
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero__title {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero__title em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    .hero__description {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #64748b;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }

    .hero__actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* === PORTFOLIO GRID === */
    .portfolio {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .portfolio__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .portfolio__card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .portfolio__card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .portfolio__card-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
      background: #e2e8f0;
    }

    .portfolio__card-body {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .portfolio__card-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ccfbf1;
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .portfolio__card-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .portfolio__card-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* === ABOUT === */
    .about {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .about__content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about__text p {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .about__stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about__stat-number {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0d9488;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .about__stat-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* === CONTACT === */
    .contact {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact__form {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .contact__form label {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .contact__form input,
    .contact__form textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #1e293b;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .contact__form input:focus,
    .contact__form textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #0d9488;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.1);
    }

    .contact__form textarea {
      min-height: 140px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .contact__form button {
      align-self: flex-start;
    }

    /* === FOOTER === */
    .footer {
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #94a3b8;
      padding: 40px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer__social {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .footer__social a {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .footer__social a:hover {
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    .footer__copy {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .footer__copy a {
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    /* === RESPONSIVE === */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .about__content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about__stats {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      }

      .hero__title {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .navbar__links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 110px 0 60px;
      }

      .hero__title {
        font-size: 1.9rem;
      }

      .portfolio__grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about__stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- NAVIGATION -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="#" class="navbar__logo">__TOPIC__<span>.</span></a>
      <ul class="navbar__links">
        <li><a href="#portfolio">Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="hero__badge">✦ Available for projects</span>
      <h1 class="hero__title">
        Crafting digital experiences<br/>for <em>__TOPIC__</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__description">
        I design and build clean, accessible, performant web interfaces.
        Let's create something remarkable together.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a href="#portfolio" class="btn btn--primary">View my work</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--outline">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PORTFOLIO -->
  <section class="portfolio" id="portfolio">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Selected work</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">A curated collection of projects I've designed and developed.</p>
      <div class="portfolio__grid">
        <article class="portfolio__card">
          <div class="portfolio__card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ccfbf1, #99f6e4);"></div>
          <div class="portfolio__card-body">
            <span class="portfolio__card-tag">Design</span>
            <h3 class="portfolio__card-title">Project Alpha</h3>
            <p class="portfolio__card-text">A full redesign for a SaaS platform focused on __TOPIC__.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="portfolio__card">
          <div class="portfolio__card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c7d2fe, #a5b4fc);"></div>
          <div class="portfolio__card-body">
            <span class="portfolio__card-tag">Development</span>
            <h3 class="portfolio__card-title">Project Beta</h3>
            <p class="portfolio__card-text">Built a real-time dashboard that visualizes __TOPIC__ data.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="portfolio__card">
          <div class="portfolio__card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fecaca, #fca5a5);"></div>
          <div class="portfolio__card-body">
            <span class="portfolio__card-tag">Branding</span>
            <h3 class="portfolio__card-title">Project Gamma</h3>
            <p class="portfolio__card-text">End-to-end brand identity for a __TOPIC__ startup.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about__content">
        <div class="about__text">
          <h2 class="section-title">About me</h2>
          <p>
            I'm a designer and developer passionate about __TOPIC__. With over a decade
            of experience in the industry, I help businesses turn complex ideas into
            intuitive, beautiful digital products.
          </p>
          <p>
            My process is collaborative, research-driven, and focused on delivering
            measurable outcomes — not just pretty screens.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stats">
          <div>
            <div class="about__stat-number">12+</div>
            <div class="about__stat-label">Years experience</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="about__stat-number">80+</div>
            <div class="about__stat-label">Projects delivered</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="about__stat-number">30+</div>
            <div class="about__stat-label">Happy clients</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Let's work together</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Have a project in mind? I'd love to hear about it. Drop me a message and I'll get back to you within 24 hours.
      </p>
      <form class="contact__form">
        <div>
          <label for="name">Your name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Jane Doe" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="email">Email address</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="jane@example.com" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" placeholder="Tell me about your project…"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Send message</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer__social">
        <a href="#" aria-label="GitHub">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter">Twitter</a>
        <a href="#" aria-label="Dribbble">Dribbble</a>
      </div>
      <p class="footer__copy">
        &copy; 2026 __TOPIC__ — Built with care.
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
```

The template uses a light color palette: white (#fafafa / #ffffff) backgrounds, navy/dark slate (#0f172a, #1e293b) for text, teal (#0d9488) as the accent color, and light gray (#e2e8f0) for borders and dividers. The CSS includes responsive breakpoints at 900px and 640px for tablets and mobile devices. The design is intentionally minimal — generous whitespace, subtle hover effects, and a clean typographic hierarchy ensure it works well for any __TOPIC__.
